* Test git gq fold
---------------------------------------


-------------------------------------------------
initial state
-------------------------------------------------

$ git gq applied
abcdef0 script.sh was improved.
abcdef0 README was improved.

$ git gq unapplied

-------------------------------------------------
create two fold patches, README-fold, README-fold2
-------------------------------------------------


# Change README.txt again ...
$ git gq new README-fold
[master abcdef0] README-fold
1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
# Add a file named 'extra.txt'.
$git add extra.txt
Delete file 'script.sh'.
rm 'script.sh'
Rename README.txt to README2.txt
$ git mv README.txt README2.txt
$ git gq new README-fold2
[master abcdef0] README-fold2
3 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 4 deletions(-)
rename README.txt => README2.txt (100%)
create mode 100644 extra.txt
delete mode 100755 script.sh

$ git show HEAD
commit abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789
Author: Homer Simpson <simpson@burns-powerplant.com>
Date: Sun Dec 31 09:12:34 2001 +0100

README-fold2

diff --git a/README.txt b/README2.txt
similarity index 100%
rename from README.txt
rename to README2.txt
